Hi<%= " #{@user.name.split.first}" if @user.name.present? %>,

<% case @stage -%>
<% when 1 -%>
Thanks for setting up <%= @organization.name %> on Pharma Transport. The quickest way to see what it does is to record one real delivery, start to finish. It takes about ten minutes.
<% when 2 -%>
<%= @organization.name %> is <%= @done_count %> of <%= OnboardingMailer::STEPS.size %> steps into getting set up. Here's the next one.
<% else -%>
It's been a week, and <%= @organization.name %> hasn't recorded a delivery yet. If something's in the way, reply to this email and tell me what it is, or book a 20-minute call and we'll set it up together.
<% end -%>

NEXT STEP: <%= @step[:title] %>
<%= @step[:hint] %>
<%= @step_url %>
<% if @invite %>

Someone else drives? Invite your driver: <%= team_url %>
They get an email link and record pickups and deliveries from their phone.
<% end -%>
<% if @sample_data %>

Want to look around first? Load a few sample shipments from your Dashboard, then clear them with one click: <%= dashboard_url %>
<% end -%>
<% if @free_setup == :owed %>

Your free setup call is included. Reply with a couple of times that work and we'll do it together.
<% elsif @free_setup == :offer %>

Start your trial before <%= DeadlineOffer.label %> and we'll set everything up with you on a call, free (normally <%= DeadlineOffer.value_label %>): <%= billing_url %>
<% end -%>
<% if @stage == 3 %>

Book a 20-minute call: <%= request_a_call_url(topic: "general") %>
<% end -%>

Brett Thomas
Pharma Transport

--
You're getting this because you're an admin on <%= @organization.name %>. These getting-started emails stop once your first delivery is recorded. Unsubscribe: <%= @unsubscribe_url %>
